<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS3" title="In Appendix G Analysis and Discussion ‣ Free-MAD: Consensus-Free Multi-Agent Debate" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.3 </span>Future Work</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
